*   [ProcessStartInfo.InheritedHandles](/en-us/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.processstartinfo.inheritedhandles#system-diagnostics-processstartinfo-inheritedhandles) — specify exactly which OS handles a child process inherits, instead of using the all-or-nothing `UseShellExecute = false` default.
