.NET console output now honors the [`FORCE_COLOR`](https://force-color.org/) standard alongside the existing `NO_COLOR` support. When `FORCE_COLOR` is set, [Console.IsOutputRedirected](/en-us/dotnet/api/system.console.isoutputredirected#system-console-isoutputredirected) no longer suppresses ANSI escape codes. This is useful when you pipe `dotnet run` output through `tee`, into a CI log viewer, or through `less -R`:

```
FORCE_COLOR=1 dotnet run | tee build.log
```

